      "font size" : 9.963,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "Subproblem equation 8a involves minimizing the regularization function R, as deﬁned in equation 4, with respect to θ, given the current values of m and σ. This can can be efﬁciently achieved using a single iteration of the Gauss-Newton method. To ensure the stability of the θ update, it is essential to incorporate a smoothing term, as suggested by [11].",
